            "title": "Details",
            "content": "<p>Sophisticated yet functional, the Meridian Tote carries your whole day &mdash; laptop, planner, and all &mdash; in a softly structured shape that never looks like it&rsquo;s working that hard.</p><p>Short top handles for the hand or the forearm, and a removable adjustable crossbody strap in the box for the days you need both hands.</p>"
